# The dev loop: haxe hxml/watch.hotreload.hxml, then open http://localhost:8064/. hotreload-hx's server rebuilds hxml/build.web.hxml on
# save and swaps the code into the running page; assets/ is served at /assets. What follows --run is the server's, one argument a line.
-lib hotreload-hx
--run hotreload.DevServer
--port
8064
--mount
/assets=assets
hxml/build.web.hxml
